00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:47.700
you rapidly reallocate a portion of your portfolio away from defensive commodity heavy sectors

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:53.000
and toward broader market or consumer facing sectors that perform better in a lower uncertainty

