00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:08.500
and the rotation window opened. The approach starts with monitoring headline risk in real time.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:13.200
You don't need to be a geopolitical expert, but you do need to recognize when the narrative has

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:18.200
shifted from escalation to negotiation. Once that shift is confirmed, the playbook is to reduce

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:23.840
exposure to energy and materials while increasing exposure to technology, consumer discretionary,

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:30.200
or broad market ETFs. Here's how you might implement it in practice. Using a brokerage screener on either

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:36.220
quest rate or wealth simple, you can quickly flag any energy-heavy holdings in your TFSA or RRSP.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:43.280
If oil prices ease more than 2% on de-escalation news, you might rotate a 10-15% sleeve of the

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:51.700
portfolio into a broad market ETF like XIC or a technology-focused ETF. The historical sweet spot for

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:58.460
this type of rotation is the 24-72 hours following major geopolitical pauses before the market fully

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:03.940
digests and prices in the new reality. Of course, no strategy is without risk. The biggest danger

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:08.940
is a rapid reversal if the talks collapse or new information emerges that reignites tensions.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:15.060
That's why position sizing is critical. I recommend limiting any single rotation to no more than 5%

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:20.340
of portfolio risk using tight-trailing stops and being prepared to exit if the original catalyst

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:28.200
deteriorates. In Canadian tax-advantaged accounts like a TFSA or RRSP, these moves can be executed

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:33.860
in just a few clicks without triggering superficial loss rules or complicating your adjusted cost-based

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:38.660
tracking. The edge comes from acting inside that narrow window before the broader market fully

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:43.820
