00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:20.740
During geopolitical shocks, automated market makers and high-frequency participants often

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:25.340
temporarily reduce size or widen spreads to protect themselves against adverse selection.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:30.700
